<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-028-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.159784" lon="-120.796864"><name>SC26-028-B</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 7.3 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 68/100; not catch probability. Center 64 ft; nearby 62–86 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-009</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 100-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.16045049138549" lon="-120.79635216289648"/><trkpt lat="35.16036038624411" lon="-120.79635459423304"/><trkpt lat="35.160366375815585" lon="-120.79668375504508"/><trkpt lat="35.16009606032281" lon="-120.79669104790266"/><trkpt lat="35.16009406391813" lon="-120.79658132798365"/><trkpt lat="35.159819755364474" lon="-120.79636918202577"/><trkpt lat="35.159813765018924" lon="-120.79604002348553"/><trkpt lat="35.159273134205016" lon="-120.79605461306447"/><trkpt lat="35.159266801628675" lon="-120.79596522567819"/><trkpt lat="35.1590237113194" lon="-120.79627464706941"/><trkpt lat="35.158896367147925" lon="-120.79667378977184"/><trkpt lat="35.15890415561425" lon="-120.79710188947112"/><trkpt lat="35.15904589110495" lon="-120.79749377387313"/><trkpt lat="35.15929999632764" lon="-120.79778978342082"/><trkpt lat="35.15962778687672" lon="-120.79794485316505"/><trkpt lat="35.15997936010833" lon="-120.79793537359909"/><trkpt lat="35.160301192075046" lon="-120.79776278589651"/><trkpt lat="35.160544286126076" lon="-120.79745336367958"/><tr